---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";

const loginUrl = "https://app.meetmilton.com/login";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Pricing: $5.01 a month after a 30-day free trial | Milton"
  description="One plan: $5.01 USD a month after a 30-day free trial. No credit card required to start. You’re charged only if you add a card."
>
  <div class="pricing">
    <header class="pricing-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">## Pricing</p>
      <h1>$5.01 USD a month.</h1>
      <p class="intro">One plan. Start with a 30-day free trial.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="sheet offer" aria-labelledby="offer-heading">
      <div class="sheet-bar">
        <h2 id="offer-heading">Your writing, on file</h2>
        <span>One plan</span>
      </div>
      <div class="sheet-content">
        <ul class="instruction-list">
          <li>Your writing rules and examples, kept as you approve them.</li>
          <li>Writing memos available to the AIs you connect.</li>
          <li>Your cover sheet and reports to view and download.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-action">
        <div>
          <p>No credit card required to start.</p>
          <p class="small-note">You’re charged only if you add a card.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="button" href={loginUrl}>
          Try Milton free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p class="accounting-note">
      Five dollars for Milton. One cent for accounting.
    </p>

    <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">## FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-heading">Before you sign.</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens after the free trial?</summary>
        <p>
          If you add a card, you’re charged $5.01 USD a month when the 30 days
          end. Otherwise, nothing is charged, and AI reads and saves pause until
          you subscribe. Your cover sheet and reports stay in the Milton app to
          view and download.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I cancel?</summary>
        <p>
          Open Stripe’s billing portal from the account menu in the Milton app.
          You can cancel at any time; cancellation takes effect at the end of
          the current billing period.{" "}
          <a href="/terms">Payment and refund terms.</a>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will my AI always read the memo?</summary>
        <p>
          We ask your AI to read it. When and how it follows the memo is still
          up to the AI. Our position is enterprise-grade asking nicely.
        </p>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  :where(.pricing) :where(h1, h2, p) {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .pricing :where(p, li) {
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .pricing-head {
    padding-block: var(--space-16) var(--space-8);
  }
  h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-hero);
    line-height: var(--leading-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .intro {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
  }
  .offer .sheet-bar h2 {
    font: inherit;
    letter-spacing: inherit;
  }
  .offer-action {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--sheet-padding);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .offer-action .small-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
  .accounting-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--muted);
    font: var(--text-caption) / var(--leading-label) var(--font-mono);
  }
  .faq {
    padding-block: var(--space-16);
  }
  .faq h2 {
    margin-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-section);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .faq details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
  }
  .faq details:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .faq summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style-position: outside;
    margin-inline-start: var(--space-5);
    min-height: var(--touch-target);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .faq details p {
    margin-block: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .pricing-head {
      padding-block: var(--space-10) var(--space-6);
    }
    .intro {
      font-size: var(--text-body);
    }
    .offer-action {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .faq {
      padding-block: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
</style>
